NAME
       pvscan - list all physical volumes found on the disks

SYNOPSIS
       pvscan

DESCRIPTION
       pvscan looks at every disk for physical volumes and prints one line
       per PV: the device, its volume group, the total size and the free
       space, then a total line. pvs shows the same information as a table.

EXAMPLES
           pvscan

SEE ALSO
       pvs(8), lvscan(8), vgscan(8), lvm(8)
